Improved REST API list-endpoint performance, significantly so for deeply-nested models such as Device components, by caching each model's derived `natural_key_field_lookups` instead of re-deriving it for every serialized object's `natural_slug`. The cache is automatically invalidated when the Location tree depth may have changed or when the `LOCATION_NAME_AS_NATURAL_KEY` or `DEVICE_UNIQUENESS` settings are updated.
